[(2017) 16 SCC 680] has clarified the law under FAO-4233-2007 2007 (O&M) -10- Sections 166, 66,
163-A 163 A and 168 of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988, on the following aspects:-
(A) Deduction of personal and living expenses to determine multiplicand;
(B) Selection of multiplier depending on age of deceased; (C) Age of deceased on basis for applying multi multiplier;
(D) Reasonable figures on conventional heads, namely, loss of estate, loss of consortium and funeral expenses, with escalation; (E) Future prospects for all categories of persons and for different ages: with permanent job; self-employed self employed or fixed sal salary.
